    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "So, what do you think this poem is really saying? What happens to a \"dream deferred\"?  What does Hughes suggest about what happens when the dreams of an individual or community are continually denied? ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Answer in 2-3 complete sentences below your poem.",
